; ted-freq-cd-start-lock (#157): the gadget "CD" of TED's file requester
; (the requester of freqlib, shared/filereq) makes the path the current
; directory of the process and unlocks the old current directory, which
; belongs to whoever started TED.  TED alone under inject cd (a lock of
; inject's own is TED's current directory); Load, CD with the requester's
; empty path (a new lock of the same directory), Cancel, QUIT.  Correct:
; at the end the start lock is TED's current directory again and was not
; unlocked; the original ends in the new lock and has unlocked the start
; lock.
; @fixed-orig #157
; @file bo.bas "a=1\n"
; @source F bo.bas
; @command TEDAB:tools/inject cd blitz2:ted @FILE@
; @expect stdout "inject: current dir at end: start\n"
; @expect nostdout "inject: current dir: the start lock was unlocked\n"
timeout 15
wait screen
menu 0 1
wait freq "Name of file to load"
gad 4
freq cancel
wait screen
menu 0 9
wait exit
